## 3. RAG Document Ingestion Pipeline

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    classDef web fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825,stroke-width:2px
    classDef process fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef store fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#7b1fa2,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef trigger fill:#ffccbc,stroke:#d84315,stroke-width:2px

    Upload["Admin Uploads Document\n(PDF / DOCX / TXT)\n🌐 English or Gujarati"]:::web

    subgraph Ingestion ["Async Ingestion Pipeline (Celery Worker)"]
        direction TB
        Detect["Detect Document\nLanguage (EN / GU)"]
        Translate["Translate GU → EN\n(Google Translate API /\nLLM-based)"]
        Parse["Parse & Extract Text\n(PyPDF2 / Unstructured)"]
        Chunk["Chunk Text\n(RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter)\n~512 tokens, 50 overlap"]
        Embed["Generate Embeddings\n(multilingual-e5-large /\nall-MiniLM-L6-v2)"]
        Upsert["Upsert to Vector Store\nw/ metadata:\nlang, source_file,\nagent_id, chunk_id"]
    end
    class Detect,Translate,Parse,Chunk,Embed,Upsert process

    VectorDB[("Vector Store\n(Qdrant / ChromaDB)")]:::store
    ObjStore[("Object Storage\n(S3 / GCS)\nOriginal Files")]:::store
    Webhook["Ingestion Trigger\n(POST /api/ingest)"]:::trigger

    Upload -- "1. Store original" --> ObjStore
    Upload -- "2. Fire webhook" --> Webhook
    Webhook -- "3. Enqueue task" --> Detect
    Detect -- "EN doc" --> Parse
    Detect -- "GU doc" --> Translate
    Translate -- "EN text" --> Parse
    Parse --> Chunk
    Chunk --> Embed
    Embed -- "4. Store vectors" --> Upsert
    Upsert --> VectorDB
```

---

## 4. Multi-Language Call Processing — Sequence Diagram

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as Caller (Hindi/Gujarati)
    participant Tel as Telephony Gateway
    participant STT as STT (faster-whisper)
    participant RAG as RAG Agent
    participant VDB as Vector Store
    participant LLM as LLM (Qwen 2.5:3B)
    participant Trans as Translator
    participant TTS as TTS Router

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Caller, Tel: Phase 1 — Call Setup
        Caller->>Tel: Inbound call to assigned number
        Tel->>Tel: Lookup agent config by phone number
        Tel->>Tel: Load persona, language pref, RAG collection
        Tel-->>Caller: Answer call, start audio stream
    end

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over Tel, STT: Phase 2 — Speech Recognition
        Tel->>STT: Stream raw audio (16kHz PCM)
        STT->>STT: Auto-detect language (HI/GU/EN)
        STT->>STT: Transcribe with distil-large-v3
        STT-->>RAG: Transcribed text + language tag
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note over RAG, LLM: Phase 3 — RAG-Augmented Response
        RAG->>RAG: Translate query to EN (if HI/GU)
        RAG->>VDB: Semantic search (EN query embedding)
        VDB-->>RAG: Top-K relevant chunks + metadata
        RAG->>LLM: Augmented prompt = system_prompt + chunks + query
        LLM-->>RAG: Stream EN response tokens
    end

    rect rgb(224, 247, 250)
        Note over Trans, TTS: Phase 4 — Translation & Speech Synthesis
        RAG->>Trans: EN response text
        Trans->>Trans: Translate EN → HI or GU (based on caller lang)
        Trans-->>TTS: Translated response text + lang tag

        alt Language = English
            TTS->>TTS: Route to Kokoro-82M
        else Language = Hindi or Gujarati
            TTS->>TTS: Route to ElevenLabs API
        end

        TTS-->>Tel: Synthesized audio stream
        Tel-->>Caller: Play audio response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over Caller, LLM: Loop continues until call ends
        Caller->>Tel: Next utterance...
        Note right of Tel: Repeat Phase 2→4
    end
```

